1
00:00:08,790 --> 00:00:11,070
What are the problems that girls face in this?

2
00:00:11,070 --> 00:00:12,030
What is your problem?

3
00:00:12,230 --> 00:00:12,870
What is the problem with cleanliness?

4
00:00:13,870 --> 00:00:14,890
Please tell us something about dogs.

5
00:00:16,670 --> 00:00:18,570
There are two types of students here.

6
00:00:20,990 --> 00:00:23,870
One loves dogs and the other is afraid of them.

7
00:00:24,890 --> 00:00:27,170
Those who love, feed them.

8
00:00:27,890 --> 00:00:29,830
And those who are afraid,

9
00:00:30,190 --> 00:00:32,110
like someone is taking a maggi or tea,

10
00:00:32,950 --> 00:00:34,550
they get scared and kill themselves.

11
00:00:37,390 --> 00:00:39,990
We get to hear a lot about it.

12
00:00:39,990 --> 00:00:41,010
That you have raised them,

13
00:00:41,010 --> 00:00:43,110
but according to me

14
00:00:43,110 --> 00:00:44,450
they should not be there.

15
00:00:45,410 --> 00:00:46,970
If they are there then

16
00:00:46,970 --> 00:00:48,290
we should arrange for them separately

17
00:00:48,290 --> 00:00:49,890
so that they don't interfere in the situation

18
00:00:49,890 --> 00:00:51,850
and love each other.

19
00:00:53,670 --> 00:00:55,650
Is there any problem with cleaning

20
00:00:55,650 --> 00:00:56,750
or is it just dogs coming inside

21
00:00:56,750 --> 00:00:59,930
and you have to clean things again and again?

22
00:01:00,150 --> 00:01:01,490
They have licked the plate

23
00:01:01,490 --> 00:01:01,970
and gone.

24
00:01:03,130 --> 00:01:04,370
They are sitting on the table.

25
00:01:18,290 --> 00:01:21,090
I got injured in the IIT 5th gate.

26
00:01:21,110 --> 00:01:25,210
I was coming at night, a car came in front of me and I was in a hurry.

27
00:01:26,190 --> 00:01:27,170
All my hands and feet were hurt.

28
00:01:27,670 --> 00:01:30,470
What should be done?

29
00:01:30,530 --> 00:01:32,910
Madam, they should be left for Nagar Nigam.

30
00:01:33,570 --> 00:01:35,050
They do whatever they want to do.

31
00:01:35,950 --> 00:01:36,670
So you shouldn't stay on campus?

32
00:01:37,310 --> 00:01:38,270
No, not according to me.

33
00:01:39,130 --> 00:01:41,590
You should leave outside the gate only.

34
00:01:41,590 --> 00:01:43,630
If there is any arrangement for them, then it's fine.

35
00:01:48,350 --> 00:01:50,710
What did you do immediately?

36
00:01:50,870 --> 00:01:53,330
You went to the hospital, what happened there?

37
00:01:54,210 --> 00:01:55,490
We took her treatment.

38
00:01:59,390 --> 00:02:01,730
Yes, I think it is fair

39
00:02:01,730 --> 00:02:04,470
Love and affection are different

40
00:02:04,470 --> 00:02:08,050
But they have to face the difficulties

41
00:02:19,990 --> 00:02:21,750
No one is going to make her sleep

42
00:02:21,750 --> 00:02:24,650
So we should remove them

43
00:02:24,650 --> 00:02:25,550
According to me

44
00:02:25,550 --> 00:02:29,950
We should do something different

45
00:02:32,570 --> 00:02:34,490
Thank you

46
00:02:35,450 --> 00:02:38,250
I will meet you after a long time

